   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"en-FI\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Roger,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">This looks like your variable names are incorrect in the model. I generally recommend not using spaces in variable names. Lavaan does not seem to be able to handle variablenames\r\n with spaces (<a href=\"https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/issues/332\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/issues/332&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414723043000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17SuL5iXaI7FfrxVTAa_1x\">https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/issues/332</a>)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">If you are new to R, I recommend\r\n<a href=\"https://r4ds.hadley.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://r4ds.hadley.nz/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414723043000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RuHP3Zqsq3giEVwv6ueWh\">https://r4ds.hadley.nz</a>. Once you get to variable renaming, apply that to remove spaces from the variable names and try estimating the model again.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Mikko<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div lang=\"en-FI\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\">From:\r\n</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of roger akanji &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">roger...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Date: </b>Thursday, 18. April 2024 at 23.47<br>\r\n<b>To: </b><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject: </b>RE: How to fit model with three dataframes<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Hi<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Good morning/afternoon<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">I am new to r language<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">I am trying to fit model with three dataframes and i get the following error messages<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all;outline:none\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quo