    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\" dir=\"auto\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"en-FI\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Roger,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">This looks like your variable names are incorrect in the model. I generally recommend not using spaces in variable names. Lavaan does not seem to be able to handle variablenames\r\n with spaces (<a href=\"https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/issues/332\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/issues/332&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414723048000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1eRBTjHcqcwKmC34Exy3Fu\">https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/issues/332</a>)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">If you are new to R, I recommend\r\n<a href=\"https://r4ds.hadley.nz/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://r4ds.hadley.nz/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414723048000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KpwS_n2dUQQfuOp_QlCGD\">https://r4ds.hadley.nz</a>. Once you get to variable renaming, apply that to remove spaces from the variable names and try estimating the model again.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Mikko<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNorma